{"unit_id":"zzy6-a__vision-use#card-zh","repo":"zzy6-a/vision-use","commit":"2476a7eb7ed6f85cf9633c4ab0f01612aafe9912","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision 是 DSH Web 客户端的视觉与 Windows 桌面操作插件，可查看本地图片或 Windows 屏幕，并通过工具操作桌面。它注册图像查看、截图、鼠标键盘、窗口和 UI Automation 控件查找及点击功能；图像作为附件交给当前会话模型。对话输入区还显示覆盖层状态和停止按钮。适合希望 agent 查看界面、查找控件并执行桌面操作的 Windows 或 WSL 用户；本地图片查看可单独使用。桌面控制需要 Windows 或带互操作的 WSL，并使用 PowerShell；图片随当前模型路由处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:325-359","lib/index.js:557-620","lib/index.js:758-943","lib/client.js:20-58"]}
{"unit_id":"zzy6-a__vision-use#card-en","repo":"zzy6-a/vision-use","commit":"2476a7eb7ed6f85cf9633c4ab0f01612aafe9912","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-vision lets DSH view local images and Windows screens, find and click UI Automation controls, and operate the desktop with mouse and keyboard tools. A composer pill reports overlay status. It suits Windows or WSL users; desktop control uses PowerShell.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:325-359","lib/index.js:557-620","lib/index.js:758-943","lib/client.js:20-58"]}
