{"unit_id":"zzy6-a__vision-use#feature-1","repo":"zzy6-a/vision-use","commit":"2476a7eb7ed6f85cf9633c4ab0f01612aafe9912","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision 的功能「查看图片和屏幕」：读取本地图片，或捕获 Windows 桌面、指定窗口或屏幕区域，并把图像作为附件交给当前会话模型。通过 view_image 或 view_screen 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:325-412"]}
{"unit_id":"zzy6-a__vision-use#feature-2","repo":"zzy6-a/vision-use","commit":"2476a7eb7ed6f85cf9633c4ab0f01612aafe9912","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision 的功能「桌面输入操作」：agent 可移动鼠标、点击、输入文字或按组合键，也可将多个动作组成一次序列调用；操作期间会启用覆盖层。通过 computer_* 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:600-750","lib/index.js:1006-1028"]}
{"unit_id":"zzy6-a__vision-use#feature-3","repo":"zzy6-a/vision-use","commit":"2476a7eb7ed6f85cf9633c4ab0f01612aafe9912","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision 的功能「查找并操作界面控件」：列出窗口、查看控件树、按名称搜索控件，并可用 UI Automation 模式点击匹配项；点击结果附带界面状态指纹。通过 uia_* 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:758-1004"]}
{"unit_id":"zzy6-a__vision-use#caveat-1","repo":"zzy6-a/vision-use","commit":"2476a7eb7ed6f85cf9633c4ab0f01612aafe9912","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision 的桌面截图和输入控制要求 Windows 原生或 WSL 加 Windows 互操作；Linux 与 macOS 上只能使用本地图片查看，桌面工具会报不支持。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:158-201","lib/index.js:359-383"]}
{"unit_id":"zzy6-a__vision-use#caveat-2","repo":"zzy6-a/vision-use","commit":"2476a7eb7ed6f85cf9633c4ab0f01612aafe9912","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision 的截图会随当前会话交给所选模型路由处理，插件自身不选择模型；使用前应确认当前模型支持图片输入。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:134-155","lib/index.js:383-385"]}
